# Umění listing

`/umeni` uses `Sections/umeni.twig`. Same feed pattern as deník and rituály.

## What belongs here

Only **discrete art objects** — commissions, gallery/institutional installations, named collaborations (e.g. Efemér pro sklárnu Rückl). Seasonal diary, folk-calendar days, place visits, and floral portraits go to **deník** (`kind=diary|portrait|…`).

## Layout

- Intro hero: flat greige on phones; from 801px white→greige gradient (same as homepage hero)
- Continuous **feed of whole art posts** (same body as detail via `Posts/body.twig` + `Posts/parts.twig`)
- Full-bleed greige shells (`.umeni-feed__item`) with a centered `.post-article` inside; `.75rem` white gaps between bands
- Title links to the standalone post URL (`linkedTitle`); no section eyebrow in the feed
- Public titles come from MaterializePosts / PostLayoutPlanner as short **work titles** (not caption openers or bare dates)
- Infinite scroll: first **4** posts, then `?page=N&partial=1` HTML fragments (`X-Feed-Next` header); JS in `static/javascript/index.js`
- No scroll / entrance animations on the index
